{"title":"Gem Iolite","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Source not yet observed</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div class=\"s muted\">No monster drops recorded for this item.</div>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>23</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=1\">1c <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=2\">2c <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=2.5\">2.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=3\">3c</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=3.5\">3.5c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=4\">4c</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 4c. Up to 2c can be made at the witch, so those count as common; bigger ones only come from finds, and a 4c gem is very rare.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Iolite found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Reaper)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>23 <span class=\"muted\">(50%)</span></td><td>61%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>Reaper: ≈2% more damage dealt to targets under 30% health</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>10 <span class=\"muted\">(22%)</span></td><td>15%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+ or the witch (3 × 0.5c)</td><td>Reaper: 4% more damage dealt to targets under 30% health</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>7 <span class=\"muted\">(15%)</span></td><td>9.9%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+ or the witch (3 × 1c)</td><td>Reaper: ≈6% more damage dealt to targets under 30% health</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>3 <span class=\"muted\">(6.5%)</span></td><td>6.9%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 40+ or the witch (3 × 1.5c)</td><td>Reaper: 8% more damage dealt to targets under 30% health</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=2.5\" title=\"Show the 2.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.85)\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">2.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-uncommon\">uncommon</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(4.3%)</span></td><td>3.6%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Reaper: ≈10% more damage dealt to targets under 30% health</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=3\" title=\"Show the 3c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.90)\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">3c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-semi-rare\">semi-rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>1.4%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Reaper: 12% more damage dealt to targets under 30% health</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=3.5\" title=\"Show the 3.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.95)\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">3.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-rare\">rare</span></td>\n      <td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(2.2%)</span></td><td>1.9%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Reaper: ≈14% more damage dealt to targets under 30% health</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-iolite?q=4\" title=\"Show the 4c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.00)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">4c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>0.6%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Reaper: 16% more damage dealt to targets under 30% health</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">46 Iolite recorded: 45 while gathering, 1 from monsters. “Of all gems found” is out of 362 gems of every kind. <a href=\"#/gemcombine\">Gem combiner</a></p>\n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic q-glow-superior\"><img src=\"data/img/5211b905fd0ac033ebac.svg\" alt=\"Gem Iolite\"></div><h3>Gem Iolite <span class=\"q-name q-superior\">(3.5c)</span></h